# Trivy vulnerability ignore list — each entry MUST carry a justification.
#
# CVE-2026-104873 — langgraph-sdk 0.2.15 (Authorization bypass)
# Justification: langgraph-sdk is a transitive dependency of langgraph; it is the
# CLIENT for the LangGraph Platform / Cloud API. Our agents run LOCAL LangGraph
# graphs (StateGraph.invoke) and never use the SDK client or talk to LangGraph
# Platform, so the authorization-bypass path is not reachable in our runtime.
# The fix requires langgraph-sdk >=0.4.4, but every langgraph release that imports
# cleanly (0.6.x) pins langgraph-sdk <0.4.4, and the one release that allows the
# fix (0.5.0) has an import-time MRO bug. Revisit when langgraph publishes a
# clean release compatible with langgraph-sdk >=0.4.4.
CVE-2026-104873
